main.content:
Tailoring provides for monks with lightweight silk armor. Raw silk is created using silk swatches and a corresponding pattern, all pieces trivial at 36. Provides a total of 37 AC (2x Wristbands) and is wearable by caster classes (NEC WIZ MAG ENC) and Monks.

